# Shippa One — environment variables
# Copy to `.env` for local development and register the same names in Vercel
# (Project Settings -> Environment Variables). Never commit real values.

# The application currently runs entirely on client-side mock data and does not
# require any environment variable to build or run. The entries below are the
# only ones the tooling understands and are all optional.

# Public base URL of the deployment (used for absolute links, optional).
# VITE_PUBLIC_URL=

# Backend credentials — only needed once Lovable Cloud / Supabase is wired up.
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
# VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
